{"type":"message","id":"94ddb3d3","parentId":"5a8226a7","timestamp":"2026-03-11T13:50:49.016Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Wcs7iSlo6yZsnyxPqfNFvynX|fc_095bd79eb74945980169b17336855881918164f286f6105451","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"C:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\auth-credential-semantics.md:39: ## Legacy-Compatible Messaging\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\brave-search.md:75: - OpenClaw uses the Brave **Search** plan. If you have a legacy subscription (e.g. the original Free plan with 2,000 queries/month), it remains valid but does not include newer features like LLM Context or higher rate limits.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\logging.md:258: - You can also enable the plugin with `openclaw plugins enable diagnostics-otel`.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\network.md:45: - [Bridge protocol (legacy nodes)](/gateway/bridge-protocol)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:14: For compatibility, OpenClaw also supports legacy Perplexity Sonar/OpenRouter setups.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:27: Optional legacy controls:\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\perplexity.md:96: For the legacy Sonar/OpenRouter compatibility path, only `query` and `freshness` are supported.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\pi-dev.md:72: - `sessions/` if legacy paths exist\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\prose.md:27: openclaw plugins enable open-prose\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\prose.md:32: Dev/local checkout: `openclaw plugins install ./extensions/open-prose`\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tts.md:206: - `enabled`: legacy toggle (doctor migrates this to `auto`).\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:51: {\"cache_key\":\"0c828040f85df6effef7a39f7d06d9158493bcfd8c0981f5d6d2c5002f06181e\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:3c8aa7ad1cfe03c1\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"3c8aa7ad1cfe03c1cb68d48f0c155903ca49f14c9b5626059d279bffc98a8f4e\",\"text\":\": connect to the Gateway WebSocket (LAN/tailnet/SSH as needed); legacy TCP bridge is deprecated/removed.\",\"translated\":\"��ͨ�� WebSocket ���ӵ� Gateway��������Ҫʹ�þ�����/Tailnet/SSH�����ɰ� TCP �Ž�������/�Ƴ���\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T13:29:04Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:231: {\"cache_key\":\"3243c3ebdcaa9521501483661e48d2fdd966942cb24ea4dcde3d06b713aed8b4\",\"segment_id\":\"index.md:3c8aa7ad1cfe03c1\",\"source_path\":\"index.md\",\"text_hash\":\"3c8aa7ad1cfe03c1cb68d48f0c155903ca49f14c9b5626059d279bffc98a8f4e\",\"text\":\": connect to the Gateway WebSocket (LAN/tailnet/SSH as needed); legacy TCP bridge is deprecated/removed.\",\"translated\":\"�����ӵ� Gateway WebSocket��������Ҫʹ�þ�����/Tailnet/SSH�����ɰ� TCP �Ž�������/�Ƴ���\",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-5\",\"src_lang\":\"en\",\"tgt_lang\":\"zh-CN\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-01T12:48:52Z\"}\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\.i18n\\zh-CN.tm.jsonl:471: {\"cache_key\":\"60b4aabf7487a78610b106bb8bdece56d18d22bc8bc54fa17ebbaffd4d111e1b\",\"segment_id\":\"start/wizard.md:28513cbd3be49624\",\"source_path\":\"start/wizard.md\",\"text_hash\":\"28513cbd3be496244d0e2e1f54d3bc382d466ca58f6b127dd6b5213e36c298b5\",\"text\":\"If the config is invalid or contains legacy keys, the wizard stops and asks\\n     you to run \",\"translated\":\"���������Ч��������������򵼻�ֹͣ��Ҫ�������� \",\"provider\":\"pi\",\"m