eMention` is honored for legacy configs but `chatmode` is preferred.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\msteams.md:27: openclaw plugins install @openclaw/msteams\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\msteams.md:33: openclaw plugins install ./extensions/msteams\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\msteams.md:244:    - From npm: `openclaw plugins install @openclaw/msteams`\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\msteams.md:245:    - From a local checkout: `openclaw plugins install ./extensions/msteams`\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\msteams.md:476:   `id:`, `e164:`, `username:`, `name:` (legacy unprefixed keys still map to `id:` only).\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\nextcloud-talk.md:19: openclaw plugins install @openclaw/nextcloud-talk\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\nextcloud-talk.md:25: openclaw plugins install ./extensions/nextcloud-talk\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\nostr.md:32: openclaw plugins install @openclaw/nostr\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\nostr.md:38: openclaw plugins install --link <path-to-openclaw>/extensions/nostr\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\pairing.md:96: - The legacy `node.pair.*` API (CLI: `openclaw nodes pending/approve`) is a\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\pairing.md:108:   - iMessage (legacy): [iMessage](/channels/imessage)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\channels\\slack.md:140:     `channels.slack.dmPolicy` controls DM access (legacy: `channels.slack.dm.policy`):\r\nC:\\User