{"type":"message","id":"5e6723a9","parentId":"2f6baae8","timestamp":"2026-03-11T13:51:17.273Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_sd1SEYqOgKb9KW69HGtwLe9X|fc_095bd79eb74945980169b17354a6a88191a22d285d9554c204","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"C:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\concepts\\context.md:158: select it with `plugins.slots.contextEngine`, OpenClaw delegates context\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\gateway\\configuration-reference.md:2325: - `plugins.slots.contextEngine`: pick the active context engine plugin id; defaults to `\"legacy\"` unless you install and select another engine.\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\plugins\\manifest.md:71:   - `kind: \"context-engine\"` is selected by `plugins.slots.contextEngine`\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tools\\plugin.md:379: - `slots`: exclusive slot selectors such as `memory` and `contextEngine`\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tools\\plugin.md:403:       contextEngine: \"legacy\", // or a plugin id such as \"lossless-claw\"\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tools\\plugin.md:412: - `contextEngine`: active context engine plugin (`\"legacy\"` is the built-in default)\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tools\\plugin.md:417: ### Context engine plugins\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tools\\plugin.md:419: Context engine plugins own session context orchestration for ingest, assembly,\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tools\\plugin.md:421: `api.registerContextEngine(id, factory)`, then select the active engine with\r\nC:\\Users\\���\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\openclaw\\docs\\tools\\plugin.md:422: `plugins.slots.contextEngine`.\r\nC:\\Use