置 `channels.feishu.defaultAccount = \\\"main\\\"`。\\n\\n### 3) 清理重复插件来源\\n- 清理重复的 `feishu` 插件来源（仅保留内置/有效加载来源）。\\n\\n### 4) 新增群组到身份绑定（核心）\\n- 新增路由绑定：\\n  - `channel: feishu`\\n  - `accountId: main`\\n  - `peer.kind: group`\\n  - `peer.id: oc_2bceed466b9c307ae06ca9df783f198c`\\n  - `agentId: zhongshu`\\n- 并确保该规则优先于通用 `taizi` 规则。\\n\\n## 三、验证结果\\n- `openclaw doctor --non-interactive`：`Feishu: ok`\\n- 网关重启成功，WhatsApp 与 Feishu链路正常。\\n- 群路由配置可读回并确认生效。\\n\\n## 四、当前状态\\n- 飞书可用。\\n- 指定群 `oc_2bceed466b9c307ae06ca9df783f198c` 已绑定到 `zhongshu` 身份处理。\\n\\n---\\n如需我再导出一份「操作日志版（含命令逐条）」或「给团队看的简版说明」，我可以马上补一版。\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":59860,"output":713,"cacheRead":4608,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65181,"cost":{"input":0.104755,"output":0.009982,"cacheRead":0.0008064,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.1155434}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773239372911}}
