",\"text\":\"**Planning concise reply with confirmation**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 你判断得很接近，但我刚查日志后，**不是被龙虾(main)截胡**，是这两个原因：\n\n1) **你这个飞书群目前被明确绑定到中书省（zhongshu）**  \n- 日志显示：`dispatching to agent (session=agent:zhongshu:feishu:group:oc_2bceed...)`  \n- 所以群里消息会先到中书省，不会先到太子。\n\n2) **有一条消息没 @bot，被忽略了**  \n- 日志也有：`message in group ... did not mention bot`\n\n---\n\n所以“太子没拿到”是对的，但根因是**群路由规则+未@**，不是 main 抢单。\n\n### 你要的正确行为（太子先接，再派中书）我可以立刻改\n我给你两个方案：\n\n- **方案A（推荐）**：这个群改绑到 **taizi**（太子总入口）\n- **方案B**：保留绑 **zhongshu**，但你在群里固定发“@openclaw 太子 …”\n\n你回我一句：**“改A”**，我马上改绑定并热重载。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ba28c7bbe20c3ee0169b189a38f7881919226a0976d9ade1c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":1026,"output":402,"cacheRead":86528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87956,"cost":{"input":0.0017955,"output":0.005628,"cacheRead":0.015142399999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0225659}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773242778870}}
